  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the textual material prompting social media interaction",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'can you tag your friend' and 'tell them i found their baby pic', which directly addresses the viewer as the one who should perform the action (tagging a friend) and implies the user is the one who 'found' the picture. This creates an implicit deictic reference to 'you' (the viewer) as the actor in the social media scenario. The projection is onto the textual material, which frames the user as the one initiating the social media behavior.",
